{
  "title": "Zesty Quick Ethiopian Lasagne Sheets Lasagna",
  "description": "A yeasty and snappy quick-fix Ethiopian dish featuring lasagne sheets, soffritto-base, and is egg-free friendly. This dish combines the flavors of Ethiopia with the comfort of lasagna.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
  "diet": [
